## Flip Ten — 30 minutes
##
## Hemisphere-flip binaural (entrain extended syntax): a 105 Hz carrier
## beat at 10 Hz — 110 Hz in the left ear, 100 Hz in the right — with the
## pair swinging between the ears on a slow 20-second pendulum (rate
## 0.05 Hz, the default). Mid-swing each ear carries both tones at equal
## power; the beat percept fades and re-forms mirrored on every flip.
##
## Headphones required. Original sbagen cannot parse this file.
##
## extended syntax: entrain

off: -
flip-ten: flip:105+10/25

00:00:00 off
00:00:15 flip-ten
00:30:00 off
